WEBVTT

01:40.110 --> 01:43.020
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.170 --> 01:45.990
[Episode 24]

02:34.980 --> 02:36.760
Wen Zongyu, I'll kill you!

02:39.829 --> 02:40.750
If you kill me,

02:40.750 --> 02:41.750
you'll die too.

02:43.340 --> 02:44.780
What do you mean?

02:46.570 --> 02:47.950
Have you never felt

02:47.950 --> 02:50.310
the burning pain in your chest?

03:04.930 --> 03:06.490
What did you do to me?

03:08.120 --> 03:10.580
Whether it's used against a human or a demon,

03:11.220 --> 03:13.680
poison is always the most effective weapon.

03:14.150 --> 03:15.740
If you want to live,

03:16.329 --> 03:18.160
you have to listen to me.

03:19.160 --> 03:20.560
I, Li Lun,

03:22.100 --> 03:23.990
never take orders from anyone!

03:24.750 --> 03:25.590
Really?

03:55.280 --> 03:57.680
Imperial Physician Liu has checked on him.

03:58.079 --> 04:01.100
He said Zhuo has serious internal injuries

04:01.230 --> 04:02.630
and his life is in danger.

04:03.160 --> 04:05.360
He couldn't find the cause

04:05.830 --> 04:08.230
and can only keep him alive with medication

04:08.350 --> 04:10.000
and daily acupuncture.

04:11.600 --> 04:13.540
Bingyi has many descendants,

04:14.190 --> 04:17.450
but only a few can be acknowledged by the Cloud Light Sword.

04:17.529 --> 04:19.730
Those who are acknowledged by the Sword

04:19.800 --> 04:21.540
will empathize with it.

04:24.060 --> 04:25.350
The Cloud Light Sword

04:25.930 --> 04:27.930
will then become his fate weapon.

04:29.850 --> 04:31.210
Fate weapon?

04:33.720 --> 04:35.470
Having a fate weapon means that

04:36.420 --> 04:38.080
as long as the sword is intact,

04:38.390 --> 04:39.650
its owner stays alive;

04:40.620 --> 04:42.080
if the sword is destroyed,

04:42.440 --> 04:43.300
its owner dies.

04:45.850 --> 04:46.550
So,

04:47.230 --> 04:49.050
that's the reason

04:49.710 --> 04:51.190
why Zhuo is in a coma.

04:55.120 --> 04:57.250
I lost control of my malicious energy…

05:01.640 --> 05:04.050
and caused the Cloud Light Sword to crack.

05:06.350 --> 05:08.560
Otherwise, Li Lun alone…

05:11.590 --> 05:14.650
wasn't powerful enough to break the Cloud Light Sword.

05:17.310 --> 05:19.720
Zhuo tried his best to save me,

05:20.940 --> 05:21.780
but I…

05:24.550 --> 05:25.640
hurt him.

06:00.710 --> 06:02.150
If Jiu were here…

06:04.560 --> 06:06.420
he'd definitely have a solution.

06:07.790 --> 06:08.810
Yes.

06:09.920 --> 06:12.650
Jiu is the most famous young physician in Tiandu.

06:13.430 --> 06:14.910
He cured a lot of people.

06:18.960 --> 06:19.750
Ms. Pei.

06:20.830 --> 06:21.740
Do you think

06:22.270 --> 06:23.240
Jiu will

06:23.910 --> 06:25.830
return to the way he used to be?

06:31.010 --> 06:33.070
I'll definitely take him back

06:34.670 --> 06:36.190
from Li Lun.

06:55.150 --> 06:55.870
Ah.

06:57.230 --> 06:57.870
How about

06:58.320 --> 07:00.050
we ask Mr. Lu Wu about it?

07:00.350 --> 07:02.820
There are many rare herbs on Mount Kunlun.

07:03.190 --> 07:03.910
Maybe

07:03.910 --> 07:05.110
Mr. Lu Wu has a way

07:05.110 --> 07:06.530
to cure Mr. Zhuo

07:06.710 --> 07:08.400
or wake Bai Jiu up.

07:11.860 --> 07:13.120
Are you coming with me?

07:16.660 --> 07:17.470
Yes.

07:27.680 --> 07:29.060
Li Lun used his inner core

07:29.060 --> 07:30.890
to live in Bai Jiu.

07:31.000 --> 07:32.060
It's much more powerful

07:32.060 --> 07:34.080
than possession by spells.

07:34.159 --> 07:35.820
It's hard to get rid of him.

07:36.390 --> 07:37.220
Is there

07:37.350 --> 07:39.020
no solution at all?

07:40.680 --> 07:41.320
There is.

07:41.940 --> 07:44.010
You need the help of Bingyi's descendants.

07:44.010 --> 07:45.030
They can use the Cloud Light Sword

07:45.030 --> 07:48.360
to separate the parasitic primordial spirit from the host.

07:48.470 --> 07:49.530
Cloud Light Sword?

07:50.590 --> 07:51.390
Mr. Zhuo?

07:54.360 --> 07:55.690
But I heard

07:55.990 --> 07:58.320
the Cloud Light Sword has been destroyed.

08:00.090 --> 08:00.890
Mr. Lu Wu,

08:01.870 --> 08:02.870
Mr. Zhuo

08:02.900 --> 08:03.990
is in a coma now.

08:04.650 --> 08:05.750
Is there any way

08:05.750 --> 08:06.900
to wake him up?

08:07.750 --> 08:09.170
There is Gui Wood in the Wilderness.

08:09.170 --> 08:10.870
Eating it can restore his energy

08:10.870 --> 08:13.480
and slow down his deterioration.

08:14.390 --> 08:15.230
Gui Wood?

08:16.950 --> 08:17.650
Okay.

08:18.030 --> 08:19.040
I got it.

08:20.590 --> 08:21.380
Ms. Pei.

08:22.800 --> 08:24.200
I'll send you back first.

08:24.280 --> 08:25.290
I'll go with you.

08:25.320 --> 08:26.360
No.

08:26.750 --> 08:27.750
Gui Wood grows

08:27.750 --> 08:29.820
in the crevices of black rocks along the seaside in the Wilderness.

08:29.820 --> 08:31.370
Sea scorpions are everywhere.

08:31.370 --> 08:33.370
There are also red-bellied snakes.

08:33.520 --> 08:34.919
Since it's so dangerous,

08:35.320 --> 08:37.320
I can't let you go alone.

08:37.950 --> 08:39.309
You're still injured.

08:39.669 --> 08:40.780
Let me go.

08:40.809 --> 08:42.350
You're not familiar with the Wilderness,

08:42.350 --> 08:43.640
and there are demons everywhere.

08:43.640 --> 08:44.520
I'll go.

08:44.790 --> 08:46.190
I'll bring Gui Wood back.

08:47.340 --> 08:48.280
Mr. Zhuo

08:48.350 --> 08:50.280
is the person Jiu admires the most.

08:50.950 --> 08:52.430
I must wake him up.

08:53.880 --> 08:54.790
You should stay

08:55.110 --> 08:56.170
to accompany Xiao.

08:57.170 --> 08:58.970
Goddess needs you more than I do.

09:10.230 --> 09:10.930
Sir.

09:25.120 --> 09:26.400
You're back.

09:27.200 --> 09:28.400
How do you feel?

09:29.630 --> 09:30.960
Thank you

09:31.040 --> 09:32.260
for your treatment.

09:33.310 --> 09:34.960
I'm right as rain now.

09:35.220 --> 09:36.940
Even better than I was

09:37.230 --> 09:38.230
before I got hurt.

09:44.160 --> 09:45.190
Commander,

09:45.190 --> 09:46.190
according to the spy,

09:46.190 --> 09:49.520
Zhuo Yichen from the Demon Hunting Bureau is sick and dying.

09:51.860 --> 09:54.890
Only Zhuo Yichen can kill Zhao Yuanzhou.

09:55.430 --> 09:57.130
He can't die!

10:04.950 --> 10:06.030
What's wrong?

10:14.770 --> 10:16.440
Wen Zongyu's poison.

10:18.080 --> 10:18.870
Poison?

10:19.940 --> 10:21.330
This can wait.

10:22.310 --> 10:25.310
The most important thing now is the Cloud Light Sword.

10:28.100 --> 10:30.040
It can remove my primordial spirit

10:30.990 --> 10:33.000
from Bai Jiu's body.

10:34.700 --> 10:36.780
It's the only thing

10:37.150 --> 10:39.150
I'm afraid of now.

10:39.950 --> 10:41.350
But the Cloud Light Sword

10:42.480 --> 10:44.580
has been destroyed, hasn't it?

10:46.770 --> 10:49.030
If we can't repair the Cloud Light Sword,

10:50.440 --> 10:52.470
Zhuo will keep deteriorating

10:53.580 --> 10:55.340
until he dies.

10:58.080 --> 11:00.280
How can we repair the Cloud Light Sword?

11:02.670 --> 11:05.000
The Cloud Light Sword could be destroyed,

11:05.850 --> 11:07.320
so it can be repaired.

11:10.950 --> 11:12.240
I'll go stop them.

11:12.870 --> 11:13.670
No need.

11:16.710 --> 11:18.410
I have a better plan.

11:34.270 --> 11:34.800
Brother.

11:35.070 --> 11:36.200
You're amazing.

11:36.370 --> 11:37.820
The sword technique just now

11:37.820 --> 11:38.920
looked so cool.

11:47.330 --> 11:48.450
Unfortunately,

11:49.630 --> 11:51.530
the Cloud Light Sword

11:51.880 --> 11:54.260
is only a normal sword in my hand.

11:56.060 --> 11:57.460
I can't wake it up.

11:59.260 --> 12:00.070
Wake it up?

12:01.600 --> 12:03.260
This sword can be awakened?

12:03.930 --> 12:05.760
Once awakened, the Cloud Light Sword

12:05.760 --> 12:07.270
can shake the sun and moon

12:07.290 --> 12:08.860
and make the earth tremble.

12:09.270 --> 12:11.890
As long as the one using it is strong enough,

12:13.000 --> 12:15.460
the Cloud Light Sword will awaken on itself.

12:24.870 --> 12:27.930
Brother, you're so powerful but still can't wake it up.

12:28.640 --> 12:30.830
I'm definitely hopeless.

12:42.010 --> 12:44.230
Yichen, have faith in yourself.

12:45.290 --> 12:46.640
After you grow up,

12:47.330 --> 12:49.790
you'll absolutely be more powerful than me.

12:53.070 --> 12:55.330
Then I'll try my best to catch up with you.

12:55.480 --> 12:56.280
Okay.

13:00.670 --> 13:01.920
But later,

13:01.960 --> 13:03.900
I'll go out with Father

13:04.420 --> 13:06.060
to catch a great demon.

13:07.350 --> 13:08.520
When I come back,

13:08.540 --> 13:10.660
I'll teach you the technique just now,

13:10.660 --> 13:11.510
okay?

13:12.790 --> 13:13.750
Deal!

14:26.990 --> 14:28.120
Where is my brother?

14:32.770 --> 14:33.960
Say something.

14:37.360 --> 14:38.490
Where is my brother?

15:27.590 --> 15:28.380
Brother.

15:30.390 --> 15:33.720
You promised to come back and teach me that sword technique.

15:35.040 --> 15:37.030
We made a deal.

15:48.120 --> 15:49.990
♫Someone is singing♫

15:50.070 --> 15:52.270
♫Can you hear it?♫

15:53.440 --> 15:55.970
♫The burning hoarseness♫

15:54.910 --> 15:55.720
Brother,

15:56.210 --> 15:58.580
I swear to be acknowledged by the Cloud Light Sword

15:56.270 --> 15:58.150
♫It sprouts♫

15:58.190 --> 16:00.090
♫And then blooms♫

15:59.210 --> 15:59.850
and learn

15:59.870 --> 16:01.970
the technique you didn't get to teach me.

16:00.530 --> 16:03.650
♫The time of loneliness♫

16:03.570 --> 16:05.480
I'll avenge you and Father.

16:04.770 --> 16:06.680
♫Someone is singing♫

16:06.750 --> 16:08.590
♫I hold the light♫

16:08.930 --> 16:12.610
♫Going the direction where you are♫

16:13.230 --> 16:16.880
♫The bell rings unemotionally♫

16:17.440 --> 16:20.620
♫I'm missing you again♫

16:23.580 --> 16:25.310
♫Winter snow♫

16:25.410 --> 16:27.040
♫Spring light♫

16:27.900 --> 16:30.520
♫Everything is thriving in the rain♫

16:28.190 --> 16:29.520
It still isn't working.

16:30.440 --> 16:31.240
Brother.

16:31.880 --> 16:33.610
♫Drifting♫

16:32.470 --> 16:34.150
How can I become stronger…

16:34.040 --> 16:35.840
♫Swaying♫

16:36.190 --> 16:39.160
♫Torn clothes♫

16:36.310 --> 16:38.310
to avenge you and Father?

17:38.850 --> 17:44.880
♫Someday I'll return to my old hometown♫

17:45.710 --> 17:51.780
♫Wearing old clothes but with eyes shining bright♫

17:52.600 --> 17:54.720
♫Holding brilliance in the right hand♫

17:54.750 --> 17:56.670
♫Biting down on all panic♫

17:56.690 --> 17:58.170
♫Wiping away frost with the left hand♫

17:58.220 --> 18:00.020
♫I finally look up♫

18:00.050 --> 18:02.910
♫You're in front of me♫

18:03.790 --> 18:05.950
♫Blocking the pain♫

18:18.110 --> 18:19.210
Cloud Light Sword.

18:23.030 --> 18:24.420
Cloud Light Sword.

18:25.090 --> 18:25.900
Zhuo.

18:30.000 --> 18:31.070
Zhuo.

18:33.010 --> 18:34.170
Cloud Light Sword.

18:34.830 --> 18:35.890
Cloud Light Sword.

18:36.800 --> 18:37.860
Cloud Light Sword.

18:40.120 --> 18:41.110
Cloud Light Sword!

18:41.110 --> 18:42.110
Zhuo.

18:51.270 --> 18:52.160
Zhuo.

18:54.270 --> 18:55.400
Zhuo!

18:55.900 --> 18:56.890
Zhuo!

19:55.280 --> 19:56.110
What's this?

19:56.500 --> 20:00.950
It's the Bingyi Clan's secret heirloom that has been passed down through generations.

20:00.950 --> 20:02.150
Five-Colored Stone.

20:03.710 --> 20:05.920
The kind of stone that Nuwa used

20:06.980 --> 20:08.380
to mend the sky back then?

20:09.040 --> 20:10.180
Yes.

20:11.470 --> 20:12.430
But why is it

20:12.430 --> 20:14.890
in the pool of the Demon Hunting Bureau?

20:14.910 --> 20:17.510
This mansion used to belong to the Zhuo family.

20:17.670 --> 20:20.790
The Zhuo family has kept the Five-Colored Stone for generations.

20:20.790 --> 20:22.580
It can mend the sky

20:23.150 --> 20:24.830
and repair everything.

20:25.430 --> 20:26.710
So I guess

20:28.700 --> 20:32.030
the Five-Colored Stone sensed the broken Cloud Light Sword

20:32.990 --> 20:34.710
and showed up itself.

20:35.290 --> 20:35.910
Great!

20:35.910 --> 20:36.470
But…

20:38.240 --> 20:39.580
Zhuo can be saved.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.330
Jiu?

21:20.420 --> 21:21.230
Li Lun.

21:22.990 --> 21:25.250
Do you have to destroy every hope we have?

21:25.790 --> 21:27.700
Can't you spare Zhuo's life?

21:28.110 --> 21:29.330
What about me?

21:31.740 --> 21:34.170
Who will spare my life?

21:35.760 --> 21:38.160
Both Zhuo Yichen and Bai Jiu are my friends.

21:40.830 --> 21:42.290
I must save them.

21:44.050 --> 21:46.580
I used to be your friend too.

21:46.610 --> 21:48.210
I didn't want this to happen.

21:48.880 --> 21:51.000
You brought it on yourself.

21:53.990 --> 21:55.280
You didn't want to,

21:57.460 --> 21:59.520
but you still did it.

22:00.400 --> 22:02.180
You started all this.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.990
You took over Jiu's body

22:05.050 --> 22:06.680
and live in it.

22:08.320 --> 22:10.340
I won't just sit back and watch.

22:11.450 --> 22:12.240
Oh?

22:13.440 --> 22:14.600
Really?

22:19.330 --> 22:21.460
Then I'll wait for you to come after me.

22:55.430 --> 22:56.970
Fortunately, the Five-Colored Stone

22:56.970 --> 22:58.630
wasn't taken away by Li Lun.

23:19.020 --> 23:20.700
It's Li Lun's vine.

23:24.560 --> 23:28.220
The Stone has been corroded by the demonic energy of Li Lun's vine.

23:56.950 --> 23:57.750
Zhuo!

24:01.350 --> 24:02.270
Zhuo!

24:11.080 --> 24:12.590
For the greater good,

24:12.850 --> 24:14.620
I don't mind dying.

24:14.910 --> 24:15.870
Ying Long,

24:16.300 --> 24:17.650
you don't mind dying,

24:18.200 --> 24:20.660
but have you ever thought about my feelings?

24:23.510 --> 24:24.310
Bingyi?

24:45.320 --> 24:46.730
Bingyi.

24:56.270 --> 24:57.070
I see.

24:59.120 --> 25:02.310
Li Lun didn't come for the Five-Colored Stone.

25:02.550 --> 25:03.810
Then what does he want?

25:06.100 --> 25:07.640
He wants to turn Zhuo

25:10.870 --> 25:12.000
into a demon.

25:20.010 --> 25:20.870
Gui Wood!

25:20.900 --> 25:22.430
I've brought Gui Wood back.

25:32.770 --> 25:33.630
Mr. Zhuo.

25:34.410 --> 25:35.490
What's going on?

25:54.830 --> 25:56.680
Mr. Zhuo has taken Gui Wood.

25:57.220 --> 25:58.370
Mr. Lu Wu said

25:58.820 --> 26:01.240
Gui Wood can keep Mr. Zhuo alive for now

26:01.330 --> 26:02.530
and buy him some time.

26:15.720 --> 26:17.320
Why are you so badly injured?

26:18.910 --> 26:20.230
It's not serious.

26:22.190 --> 26:22.990
Does it hurt?

26:23.620 --> 26:25.250
Just some scratches.

26:25.810 --> 26:26.770
But

26:27.180 --> 26:28.320
they really hurt.

26:28.350 --> 26:29.460
I'll go with you.

26:29.480 --> 26:30.360
No, no, no.

26:30.870 --> 26:32.630
Gui Wood grows in the crevices of black rocks

26:32.630 --> 26:33.840
along the seaside in the Wilderness.

26:33.840 --> 26:35.510
Sea scorpions are everywhere.

26:35.510 --> 26:36.620
There are also red-bellied snakes.

26:36.620 --> 26:37.830
Since it's so dangerous

26:37.830 --> 26:39.060
and you're still injured,

26:39.060 --> 26:39.980
let me go.

26:40.010 --> 26:41.510
You're not familiar with the Wilderness.

26:41.510 --> 26:42.540
I'll go.

26:43.160 --> 26:44.820
I'll definitely get Gui Wood.

26:57.160 --> 26:59.210
But as long as it can save Mr. Zhuo,

26:59.720 --> 27:00.720
it's all worth it.

27:04.070 --> 27:05.200
It's useless.

27:06.190 --> 27:07.770
You brought Gui Wood back,

27:08.520 --> 27:10.250
but it's just a band-aid fix.

27:15.290 --> 27:17.150
Don't be so cruel, Zhao Yuanzhou.

27:17.700 --> 27:19.830
It was hard for Ying Lei to get Gui Wood.

27:22.730 --> 27:24.940
I just don't want you to be hopeful

27:25.430 --> 27:27.230
and then greatly disappointed.

27:27.610 --> 27:29.260
Prepare for the worst.

27:29.280 --> 27:31.280
What is the worst that could happen?

27:45.660 --> 27:47.520
Breaking the Five-Colored Stone

27:48.230 --> 27:51.140
was worse than breaking the Cloud Light Sword.

27:52.340 --> 27:53.830
The Five-Colored Stone was a sacred object of the Bingyi Clan

27:53.830 --> 27:56.090
that had been passed down from generation to generation.

27:56.090 --> 27:59.020
Besides the ability to repair the Cloud Light Sword,

27:59.020 --> 28:00.970
it was also a very important…

28:02.670 --> 28:03.710
vessel.

28:04.270 --> 28:05.210
Vessel?

28:06.300 --> 28:07.790
To be precise,

28:09.190 --> 28:11.550
it was a vessel for suppression.

28:15.920 --> 28:17.450
You mean that drop of blood?

28:19.210 --> 28:20.660
It was demon blood.

28:24.350 --> 28:25.420
Demon blood?

28:28.420 --> 28:30.890
Back then, Zhuan Xu and Gong Gong started a great war.

28:30.890 --> 28:33.260
Ying Long and Bingyi were involved in it

28:33.990 --> 28:35.340
and fought together.

28:36.220 --> 28:37.760
But legend has it that

28:38.710 --> 28:40.370
Bingyi killed Ying Long

28:40.760 --> 28:42.580
and used his bone

28:42.750 --> 28:44.130
and soul

28:44.490 --> 28:46.640
to forge the Cloud Light Sword.

28:47.060 --> 28:49.260
If they once fought together,

28:49.550 --> 28:50.740
why did

28:51.000 --> 28:52.800
Bingyi kill Ying Long?

28:53.000 --> 28:53.990
It's said that

28:54.020 --> 28:56.180
after Gong Gong crashed Mount Buzhou,

28:56.360 --> 28:58.690
the world was thrown into chaos.

28:59.040 --> 29:01.200
But Ying Long kept causing havoc

29:01.340 --> 29:02.620
to destroy the world.

29:02.660 --> 29:05.520
He even attempted to stop Nuwa from mending the sky.

29:06.080 --> 29:08.600
Fortunately, Bingyi came to his senses in time.

29:08.600 --> 29:09.930
He realized his mistake

29:10.750 --> 29:12.030
and killed Ying Long.

29:13.920 --> 29:15.300
In that case…

29:18.430 --> 29:20.040
Bingyi was also a demon?

29:22.550 --> 29:23.340
Yes.

29:24.300 --> 29:25.760
Bingyi killed

29:26.110 --> 29:28.460
many evil demons in his time,

29:28.880 --> 29:31.120
so people have always seen him as a god.

29:31.700 --> 29:32.930
But in fact,

29:34.220 --> 29:36.900
he was a great demon born in the Wilderness.

29:39.800 --> 29:40.610
Stop!

29:46.510 --> 29:47.950
You want to catch me?

29:47.980 --> 29:49.580
Demons are evil.

29:49.710 --> 29:51.080
Of course I have to catch you.

29:51.080 --> 29:53.590
But your ancestor was also a demon.

29:54.380 --> 29:56.180
Are you sure you want to catch me?

30:00.610 --> 30:02.640
Why are these stairs so...

30:07.280 --> 30:08.350
Where is Ao Ying?

30:10.120 --> 30:11.390
She escaped.

30:15.130 --> 30:16.080
So...

30:18.010 --> 30:19.120
Zhuo

30:20.870 --> 30:21.870
is also a demon?

30:23.400 --> 30:24.380
Zhuo

30:24.810 --> 30:25.780
is a human.

30:29.550 --> 30:31.270
You're confusing me.

30:33.470 --> 30:35.330
After the battle at Mount Buzhou,

30:36.470 --> 30:38.670
Bingyi wanted to live a reclusive life.

30:38.970 --> 30:41.740
Touched by his heroic deed of killing Ying Long,

30:42.580 --> 30:43.630
Nuwa gifted him

30:43.630 --> 30:45.630
the last Five-Colored Stone

30:46.330 --> 30:47.790
left from mending the sky.

30:48.340 --> 30:50.220
And as Bingyi wished,

30:50.330 --> 30:52.070
she removed his inner core

30:52.860 --> 30:54.530
and purified his demonic energy,

30:54.530 --> 30:56.060
changing him into a mortal.

30:56.530 --> 30:58.950
Since then, Bingyi had lived in the mortal world

30:58.950 --> 31:00.290
in seclusion.

31:02.630 --> 31:04.420
So his descendants

31:05.560 --> 31:07.170
are not demons

31:08.050 --> 31:09.140
but humans.

31:16.720 --> 31:18.950
So the blood in the Five-Colored Stone

31:19.020 --> 31:20.610
was from Bingyi?

31:20.760 --> 31:22.370
Although Nuwa respected

31:22.390 --> 31:24.450
Bingyi's wish to become a mortal,

31:25.260 --> 31:26.590
she couldn't bear to see

31:26.800 --> 31:29.240
Bingyi's rare great power

31:29.390 --> 31:31.340
disappear from the world.

31:31.490 --> 31:33.030
So she sealed a drop of Bingyi's blood

31:33.030 --> 31:35.110
in the Five-Colored Stone

31:35.130 --> 31:36.530
and let it be passed down.

31:37.630 --> 31:38.920
That drop of blood

31:39.270 --> 31:40.760
was the last thing from Bingyi

31:40.760 --> 31:42.310
in this world.

31:44.830 --> 31:46.950
For Bingyi's descendants,

31:47.920 --> 31:50.540
it's sort of a way of undoing that decision.

31:51.510 --> 31:53.230
It allows them

31:53.510 --> 31:55.440
to choose their identities again.

31:58.730 --> 31:59.620
So…

32:02.320 --> 32:04.300
Zhuo will become a demon too,

32:04.750 --> 32:05.710
right?

32:07.370 --> 32:09.120
Once the ink drops into the water,

32:09.120 --> 32:11.050
it's impossible to separate them.

32:11.520 --> 32:13.320
Once he starts becoming a demon,

32:15.280 --> 32:17.010
the process can't be reversed.

32:19.290 --> 32:20.060
No.

32:20.630 --> 32:21.650
No, no, no.

32:22.110 --> 32:24.110
You're probably thinking too much.

32:24.450 --> 32:26.300
Mr. Zhuo is a mortal.

32:26.320 --> 32:27.980
He doesn't have an inner core.

32:27.990 --> 32:29.490
Even if he has demonic power,

32:29.490 --> 32:30.950
it can't change anything.

32:31.570 --> 32:32.900
He can't become a demon.

32:33.790 --> 32:34.910
You're right.

32:35.970 --> 32:37.770
That's the worst-case scenario

32:38.090 --> 32:39.410
I mentioned.

32:40.810 --> 32:42.810
A mortal without an inner core

32:44.510 --> 32:46.740
can't absorb and carry demonic power.

32:47.230 --> 32:49.500
Once Bingyi's immense demonic power awakens,

32:49.500 --> 32:51.380
it'll rage through

32:51.410 --> 32:52.980
Zhuo's body

32:53.850 --> 32:55.490
until his veins burst.

32:56.230 --> 32:57.470
All his organs

32:58.170 --> 32:59.790
will be torn apart.

33:00.420 --> 33:03.080
When the demon blood completely takes control,

33:05.000 --> 33:06.630
he'll die.

33:13.330 --> 33:15.070
Is there no way to save him?

33:16.330 --> 33:17.610
As far as I know,

33:19.410 --> 33:20.390
no.

33:23.220 --> 33:24.180
Unless...

33:24.210 --> 33:25.330
What?

33:27.210 --> 33:30.140
Unless we go to the forbidden area of the Bingyi Clan.

33:30.670 --> 33:31.780
There,

33:32.570 --> 33:35.240
we might find a way to save Zhuo.

33:42.120 --> 33:42.990
Ms. Pei,

33:43.310 --> 33:45.970
are we really going to the sacred site of the Bingyi Clan?

33:45.970 --> 33:47.430
The old Mountain Gods said

33:47.650 --> 33:48.940
that's a scary place.

33:50.310 --> 33:51.100
Stop there!

33:56.500 --> 33:57.400
It's you.

33:58.550 --> 34:00.220
I'm here to check on

34:00.380 --> 34:02.350
Commander Zhuo's injuries.

34:03.930 --> 34:06.460
You're like a weasel pretending to be caring.

34:09.730 --> 34:11.880
Or a tiger pretending to be softhearted.

34:11.880 --> 34:13.280
You're like a cockroach…

34:15.310 --> 34:17.310
Everyone knows you're up to no good.

34:17.670 --> 34:19.219
I do care for him.

34:21.080 --> 34:22.940
I'm worried that Mr. Zhuo may die.

34:23.350 --> 34:25.929
Your meridians were crushed by Zhao Yuanzhou's violent demonic power,

34:25.929 --> 34:26.929
but you survived.

34:27.190 --> 34:29.340
How could anything happen to Mr. Zhuo?

34:29.590 --> 34:31.389
Born into a rich family, Mr. Zhuo

34:31.719 --> 34:33.600
is fragile.

34:33.830 --> 34:35.870
You must take good care of him.

34:38.310 --> 34:39.440
Did I hear him right?

34:40.620 --> 34:41.840
He asked us

34:42.310 --> 34:44.230
to take good care of Mr. Zhuo?

34:44.750 --> 34:45.360
Yes.

34:48.350 --> 34:49.580
Could it be that…

34:50.190 --> 34:50.909
he suddenly cares?

34:50.909 --> 34:52.370
it's Wen Zongyu's scheme?

34:55.650 --> 34:56.440
Ms. Pei.

34:56.659 --> 34:57.590
Shall I stop him?

34:58.630 --> 34:59.230
Yes.

35:16.750 --> 35:17.950
Are you hiding there?

35:31.100 --> 35:32.310
What exactly is

35:33.510 --> 35:35.440
the Bingyi Clan's forbidden area?

35:37.670 --> 35:39.800
It's the Bingyi Clan's burial ground.

35:41.260 --> 35:43.280
All their past stories and secrets

35:43.310 --> 35:45.110
are buried there.

35:46.390 --> 35:47.300
At that place,

35:48.200 --> 35:50.620
we might find a way to save Zhuo.

35:50.830 --> 35:53.060
Do you know where that area is?

35:53.790 --> 35:54.590
Of course.

35:56.950 --> 35:58.130
In the Wilderness…

36:00.210 --> 36:02.210
that place is famous.

36:03.670 --> 36:04.910
Then let's go there.

36:55.040 --> 36:59.970
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

37:00.050 --> 37:03.360
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

37:03.450 --> 37:06.460
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

37:06.520 --> 37:07.990
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

37:08.020 --> 37:12.820
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

37:12.930 --> 37:16.230
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

37:16.260 --> 37:19.330
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

37:19.370 --> 37:20.850
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

37:20.910 --> 37:26.040
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

37:26.140 --> 37:29.170
♫My definitions for right and wrong differ♫

37:29.270 --> 37:32.020
♫Bury your pride in the raging river♫

37:32.050 --> 37:34.500
♫Lamenting that all beings are powerless♫

37:34.530 --> 37:38.640
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

37:43.780 --> 37:45.170
As the old saying goes,

37:45.340 --> 37:46.690
aunts and nephews

37:46.710 --> 37:47.980
are so close

37:48.180 --> 37:49.370
that even if the bones break,

37:49.370 --> 37:50.770
the connection remains.

37:50.860 --> 37:52.870
I didn't expect you

37:53.450 --> 37:55.510
to care so much about Zhuo as his aunt.

38:00.950 --> 38:02.270
I always

38:02.270 --> 38:04.510
tease him by saying I'm his aunt,

38:06.040 --> 38:07.590
but actually,

38:08.260 --> 38:09.700
since I was young,

38:11.500 --> 38:13.600
he has been taking care of me.

38:15.080 --> 38:16.710
Once,

38:16.970 --> 38:18.600
I caught a cold.

38:20.250 --> 38:23.180
My father happened to be away for official business.

38:23.200 --> 38:24.680
So Zhuo

38:25.600 --> 38:27.080
got a doctor for me,

38:28.480 --> 38:29.740
prepared decoctions,

38:30.340 --> 38:31.940
and took care of me all night.

38:33.360 --> 38:34.870
After I recovered,

38:36.010 --> 38:37.930
he fell ill.

38:38.340 --> 38:39.580
I felt very guilty.

38:41.400 --> 38:43.210
But he actually told me that

38:44.440 --> 38:46.100
he was happy

38:47.160 --> 38:49.700
because after I gave him my cold,

38:50.030 --> 38:51.310
I could recover.

38:54.670 --> 38:56.110
He was such a fool,

38:56.880 --> 38:57.890
wasn't he?

38:59.840 --> 39:01.780
The 15-year-old Mr. Zhuo

39:04.150 --> 39:05.560
was still so childish.

39:06.420 --> 39:07.710
He was childish,

39:10.190 --> 39:11.730
but he was also sensible

39:12.560 --> 39:13.830
and strong.

39:15.590 --> 39:18.520
In the year after his father and brother passed away,

39:19.080 --> 39:20.910
he was depressed.

39:22.240 --> 39:23.640
But soon,

39:24.150 --> 39:26.030
he pulled himself together

39:26.500 --> 39:28.280
and became strong, brave,

39:28.430 --> 39:29.710
and independent.

39:30.430 --> 39:31.790
He became the talented swordsman

39:31.790 --> 39:34.310
whom everyone in Tiandu looked up to.

39:35.120 --> 39:36.110
Sometimes,

39:38.200 --> 39:39.880
people become independent

39:42.380 --> 39:44.410
not because they're sensible,

39:46.860 --> 39:48.060
but because…

39:52.510 --> 39:53.510
Because what?

39:57.970 --> 39:59.750
Because they're lonely.

40:08.500 --> 40:09.550
Are you scared?

40:13.690 --> 40:14.910
Don't be scared.

40:16.220 --> 40:17.780
Zhuo

40:18.750 --> 40:20.230
is no longer

40:20.770 --> 40:21.990
the boy he used to be.

40:24.420 --> 40:25.650
He has us.

40:28.610 --> 40:29.220
Yes.

40:31.700 --> 40:33.050
He's not lonely.

40:31.980 --> 40:38.850
♫There are countless rules in this world♫

40:33.100 --> 40:34.600
You're not the only one

40:34.860 --> 40:36.390
in the Demon Hunting Squad.

40:36.410 --> 40:38.010
You don't have to take everything on your shoulders.

40:38.010 --> 40:39.300
Let me do it.

40:39.390 --> 40:43.410
♫But none can compare to "I am willing"♫

40:40.960 --> 40:43.960
I'll go to the Wilderness to find Gui Wood for Mr. Zhuo.

40:44.220 --> 40:53.630
♫If heaven decides my destiny, I'll be its enemy♫

40:48.240 --> 40:49.390
Mr. Zhuo.

40:49.830 --> 40:52.290
I'll definitely bring Gui Wood back for you.

40:56.100 --> 41:02.890
♫I sing under the moon and swing my sword to the wind♫

41:03.370 --> 41:07.420
♫Drunk on the autumn breeze beneath the bright moon♫

41:08.080 --> 41:17.260
♫Penning small verses of a grand legend♫

41:38.110 --> 41:39.170
It's getting cold.

41:41.040 --> 41:43.040
Why are you sitting in the wind here?

41:48.970 --> 41:50.160
Sister,

41:51.520 --> 41:53.440
are you worried about Mr. Zhuo

41:55.590 --> 41:57.120
and Bai Jiu?

42:00.040 --> 42:01.930
Jiu is the youngest among us

42:03.310 --> 42:05.040
and doesn't know martial arts.

42:05.750 --> 42:07.110
He's very timid.

42:08.330 --> 42:09.910
When there was danger,

42:10.880 --> 42:13.380
he always hid behind me and Zhuo.

42:15.460 --> 42:17.890
I wonder how he is now.

42:20.160 --> 42:21.580
Is he scared?

42:25.400 --> 42:26.900
You treat Bai Jiu so well…

42:30.230 --> 42:31.870
like he's your own brother.

42:35.250 --> 42:37.200
I used to be weak and sick.

42:38.710 --> 42:40.510
You got used to taking care of me.

42:44.610 --> 42:46.250
Now that I'm a puppet,

42:48.310 --> 42:49.430
I don't feel pain

42:50.900 --> 42:52.150
or get hurt.

42:54.920 --> 42:56.770
I can protect you now.

42:59.000 --> 43:00.630
But Bai Jiu is different.

43:02.520 --> 43:04.160
He really needs you.

43:06.000 --> 43:07.210
Is that why

43:08.600 --> 43:10.190
you care and worry

43:11.610 --> 43:12.820
so much about him?

43:20.720 --> 43:21.520
Yes.

43:28.270 --> 43:29.750
But Heng

43:29.770 --> 43:30.810
is Heng.

43:32.230 --> 43:33.900
You're never anyone else,

43:35.380 --> 43:37.360
and you'll never be.

43:40.860 --> 43:42.510
No one can replace you.

43:47.280 --> 43:50.010
With you fighting alongside me,

43:51.950 --> 43:54.260
I can protect others better.

44:03.630 --> 44:04.750
I'm happy

44:07.050 --> 44:09.210
that I'm no longer your burden.

44:09.460 --> 44:11.900
I've become your armor.

44:13.040 --> 44:13.840
But...

44:18.940 --> 44:20.090
But what?

44:26.930 --> 44:27.790
Nothing.

44:58.550 --> 44:59.190
Father.

44:59.880 --> 45:00.670
Cloud Light Sword.

45:00.670 --> 45:01.430
Zhuo.

45:01.800 --> 45:02.400
Cloud…

45:03.470 --> 45:04.490
Cloud Light Sword.

45:04.490 --> 45:05.410
Zhuo.

45:22.330 --> 45:23.460
Zhuo.

45:24.850 --> 45:26.110
Where are you going?

45:26.280 --> 45:27.110
Zhuo!
